<%- include('../partials/head-open') %>

<section class="page-hero page-hero--compact">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
    <h1>Who We Are</h1>
    <p class="lede">The Utthan Foundation is an NGO working with communities across Uttar Pradesh on food security, education, livelihood, and care.</p>
    <%- include('../partials/about-nav') %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <h2>Our mission</h2>
      <p>The Utthan Foundation brings neighbors, volunteers, and partners together so help reaches villages and urban neighborhoods with dignity.</p>
      <p>From community kitchens and school kits to livelihood workshops and local relief drives, we focus on practical support that families can feel — starting in Lucknow and across Uttar Pradesh.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="media-frame">
      <img src="/images/grocery-aid-alley.jpg" alt="Community members sharing a bag of groceries">
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container split split--flip">
    <div>
      <h2>Our vision</h2>
      <p>We envision Uttar Pradesh communities where every neighbor can meet basic needs, learn with confidence, and earn with dignity — without waiting for help that never arrives.</p>
      <p>Utthan means uplift. Our vision is a network of local care strong enough that villages and city neighborhoods rise together, generation after generation.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="media-frame">
      <img src="/images/rural-classroom-teaching.jpg" alt="Teacher supporting children in a rural classroom">
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <h2>Our goal</h2>
      <p>Expand trusted, community-led programs across more districts of Uttar Pradesh — food security, education support, livelihood skills, and neighborhood care.</p>
      <p>We aim to grow with volunteers, members, and partners so every campaign is practical, accountable, and rooted in the people we serve.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="media-frame">
      <img src="/images/women-sewing-workshop.jpg" alt="Women learning skills in a livelihood workshop">
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/head-close') %>
